msgstr "Shear Angle Strain"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:5
#: 1493fa0fefbd4e348ce80c9acc3c3e27
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:7
#: 8d1236fe54f34bdc9441613023acc695
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:9
#: d6cbb8ff1170454aa2d821459c44430e
msgid ""
"在保持晶格长度不变的前提下扰动 alpha/beta/gamma 角，采样角度剪切自由度。每个"
"角度通道独立控制 min/max/step（单位：度），扫描的是相对原始角度的增量。"
msgstr ""
"Sample angular shear by changing alpha, beta, and gamma while preserving "
"lattice-vector lengths. Each channel has an independent minimum, maximum, "
"and step in degrees, interpreted as offsets from the input angle."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:11
#: e253aafc85fc4bcb84f6171aef7a6ffb
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:13
#: 63f9dcceb4194dd08e32e4fc52ee3940
msgid ""
"\\alpha'=\\alpha+\\Delta\\alpha,\\quad \\beta'=\\beta+\\Delta\\beta,\\quad "
"\\gamma'=\\gamma+\\Delta\\gamma"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:15
#: dfd42ef677494f0c8fd0763377c6a6e3
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{C}'=\\mathrm{cellpar\\_to\\_cell}(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:17
#: bf1d6407363c40b2bbba17bfa5babb1a
msgid ""
"$a,b,c$ 保持原长度，三个 $\\Delta$ 值单位均为度。程序从新的六个晶格参数重建晶"
"胞， 不是直接给某个矩阵元素加角度数值；原子分数坐标保持不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:20
#: c23ff72c49504c7f97927a117f961da1
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:22
#: 6bc0fd8c3b5c4f4fbbfeff6bdb05ed9c
msgid "场景：模型在单斜晶系上预测崩了，但正交晶系没问题"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: The model fails on a monoclinic phase but not an orthogonal one"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:24
#: 667d8a695b8444bba9ca719e0e14b9da
msgid ""
"你在 HfO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型。训练集里只有一个高温四方相（正交晶格），模型"
"对四方相的能量和力预测很好。但一跑常温单斜相，能量误差跳了 3 倍——因为单斜相"
"的 beta 角偏离 90 度约 10 度，模型没见过非正交的晶胞角度。"
msgstr ""
"A HfO2 NEP trained only on a high-temperature tetragonal phase performs well "
"there but triples its error on the monoclinic phase, whose beta angle "
"differs from 90 degrees. Nonorthogonal cell geometry is out of domain."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:26
#: 96828b6144bc43aab9a81cdfd925e0d8
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 不同晶系的本质区别是晶胞角度。模型只在正交晶格上训练，隐式地学"
"会了\"角度总是 90 度\"的先验。只要 beta 偏离 90 度，晶格矢量在笛卡尔空间的投"
"影关系就变了，原子间距分布也跟着变——模型全靠外推。解决办法是沿角度方向生成一"
"组结构，让模型见过非 90 度的晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Cell angles change the Cartesian projection of lattice "
"vectors and therefore interatomic-distance distributions. Add controlled "
"nonorthogonal cells so target angles are interpolated rather than "
"extrapolated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:28
#: 6cc13cf656b947d18c054645c932eeb7
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 HfO2 四方相结构（alpha=beta=gamma=90°）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** Relaxed tetragonal HfO2 with alpha = beta = gamma = 90 degrees."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:30
#: d6aabdf42a7545a7b8d7382672ce9fd5
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿 beta 方向生成 -6° 到 +6° 的角度扫描，步长 2°，覆盖单斜相可能出"
"现的 beta 偏离"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Scan beta offsets from -6 to +6 degrees in 2-degree steps."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:32
#: 2ab2e7e9fca0445aadd17cc07a2cae35
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:33
#: 46245342b7f14d77840ac8d9713c45c4
msgid "`α 角范围`（`alpha_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 alpha）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:34
#: 91207ab626fa45fe9cbd02a3a9fc1bfc
msgid "`β 角范围`（`beta_range`） = `[-6, 6, 2]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:35
#: 9b1d2d57230d4f72bba52e13de57cbf5
msgid "`γ 角范围`（`gamma_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 gamma）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:37
#: 0471c6104fa14b0f9cc296b2ecf6ab3c
msgid ""
"**输出：** 7 个结构（-6°, -4°, -2°, 0°, +2°, +4°, +6°），晶格长度不变，只有 "
"beta 角偏离 90 度"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Seven structures with beta offsets -6, -4, -2, 0, +2, +4, and +6 "
"degrees and unchanged lattice lengths."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:39
#: 0faacc76ec8d4c4eb31ba6152f790d65
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:40
#: 85310f9dc4d244d0b61f9dca175f6aa0
msgid "重训后用单斜相参考数据做推理，能量误差应显著下降"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, error on held-out monoclinic references "
"should decrease."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:41
#: c16bbf8c88294c76ac05fd0491bfe1f2
msgid ""
"检查输出结构的体积：角度变化会轻微改变体积（晶格长度不变但矢量投影关系变"
"了），确认体积变化 < 2%"
msgstr ""
"Check output volumes. Angles change vector projections even at fixed "
"lengths, so define and verify an acceptable volume change for the study."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:42
#: b23cae24729048aa93ae5e99e2e86f92
msgid "如果模型对更多角度方向仍不准，同时放开 alpha 和 gamma 做多角度联合扫描"
msgstr ""
"If other angular directions remain inaccurate, add alpha and gamma scans "
"deliberately."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:43
#: ceaf681228904725951eb03a6d3c1bf3
msgid ""
"如果角度扫描范围 > ±10° 后结构明显非物理，可能是该体系不支持如此大的角度偏离"
msgstr ""
"If offsets beyond ±10 degrees produce implausible geometry, narrow the range "
"to the material's intended phase space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:45
#: f245f8d2ac8747e8a1f66c9fb1d371cf
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:47
#: 59494baba9144a36b6f74b85cefb41bb
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:48
#: 227160250b15429ebffd55709d5bf90a
msgid ""
"训练集仅覆盖高对称晶系（立方、四方），但目标体系存在低对称相（单斜、三斜）"
msgstr ""
"Training covers only high-symmetry cells while target phases are monoclinic "
"or triclinic"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:49
#: 8af1f5ad6e364b5fadba0fd73bc44891
msgid "模型在角度相关性质（如压电系数、角度依赖的弹性常数）上偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Angle-dependent properties such as piezoelectric or elastic response are "
"inaccurate"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:50
#: b6556cb02e68464b89ab230ae5b82965
msgid "需要区分\"角度变化\"和\"长度变化\"对模型的影响"
msgstr "Angle and length effects need to be isolated"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:52
#: e0627584d56842f181a20b765a247919
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:53
#: 26b3968b68eb4129a48ad6a3db9f41bd
msgid "体系始终维持高对称、角度不可能偏离 90 度 —— 加了产生无物理意义结构"
msgstr ""
"The intended system remains high symmetry and angular deviations are not "
"physically relevant"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:54
#: 190d374f189a450899b1da2f3d36ef83
msgid "需要同时控制长度和角度 → 用 `Lattice Perturb` 同时扰动两者更方便"
msgstr ""
"Lengths and angles should vary stochastically together; use `Lattice Perturb`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:55
#: 5ef3f5f38c364b3483c0c84e8c6d1d87
msgid "想用矩阵分量而非角度控制剪切 → `Shear Matrix Strain` 更适合"
msgstr ""
"Shear should be parameterized by matrix components; use `Shear Matrix Strain`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:57
#: 0adf2b5ed5d3482a82c7a6f1c623a20d
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:59
#: e9f2a3201f284ec1a4ebc9a0092aa335
msgid "α 角范围（alpha_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:61
#: c876610d54214f228d161b1efc12f84a
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`。alpha 角相对于原始值的"
"增量扫描区间，格式 `[min, max, step]`，单位度。注意最终角度 = 原始角度 + 增"
"量，不是直接用增量替换。不扫的通道不能设 `[0, 0, 0]`，必须写 `[0, 0, 1]` 让 "
"range 至少产生一个 0 点。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`. Alpha-offset scan "
"as `[min,max,step]` in degrees. Final angle equals input plus offset. Use "
"`[0,0,1]`, not a zero step, for an inactive channel."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:63
#: 7fcc324221804a819b3c73336ecf2824
msgid "β 角范围（beta_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:65
#: cdd43413d606442aad562ff7108b0b21
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`。beta 角增量扫描区间，"
"单位和语法同上。不扫时写 `[0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`. Beta offsets with "
"the same syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:67
#: 088c816a2e9a41c689d92cb91bacb7bf
msgid "γ 角范围（gamma_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:69
#: ed47284c9d894fa2bfccb294526cda6b
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`。gamma 角增量扫描区间，"
"同上。不扫时写 `[0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-2.0, 2.0, 1.0)`. Gamma offsets with "
"the same syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:71
#: fdcff23ec4024223bd29805d636d42e1
msgid ""
"输出总数 = Nalpha * Nbeta * Ngamma。三个通道同时按默认值跑 = 5^3 = 125 个结"
"构。步长减半会 8 倍增长，建议从单通道开始逐次加。"
msgstr ""
"Output count is Nalpha × Nbeta × Ngamma. Three default five-point channels "
"produce 125 structures; halving every step multiplies that by eight. Begin "
"with one channel."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:73
#: dc66b697fe164ffa966ddc16bb2ee8e2
msgid "识别有机分子（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:75
#: 4e850001e41c49758d1de79b157f0736
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。分子晶体必须打开——角度变化会改变分子间相对取向，如果分"
"子内键也被跟着拉伸就不对了。纯无机体系关着即可。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable molecular protection for molecular crystals "
"so angular cell changes do not distort intramolecular bonds. Leave disabled "
"for purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:77
#: a5a3056d1b2242ab85fde322e471e028
