msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:117
#: 3b09eac088e247c885014be1729674e8
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Shear Angle Strain`：先做长度应变，再补角度剪切"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Shear Angle Strain`: add angular shear after length "
"strains"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:118
#: d05b827851674b81a3f2437d6b0f9a4a
msgid "`Shear Angle Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：角度畸变后加原子坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Shear Angle Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate fluctuations after "
"angular distortion"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:119
#: 6d7c21f15d1444deaf2f53643e9a18c9
msgid ""
"`Shear Angle Strain` + `Shear Matrix Strain`：两者走不同形变路径，互补覆盖"
msgstr ""
"Use angle and matrix shear as distinct, complementary deformation paths"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:121
#: 1bac34e34f1040069cc3850ce9ba0dc6
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:123
#: f0e7b4ce81d042afa115197516722f5d
msgid ""
"**输出为空。** 检查每个 range 的步长是否 > 0。不扫的通道不能设 `[0, 0, 0]`，"
"必须设 `[0, 0, 1]` 让 range 至少产生一个 0 点。"
msgstr ""
"**No output.** Every step must be positive. Use `[0,0,1]` for an inactive "
"channel."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:125
#: 1db4eb33dd41402caf8fcaecef08290b
msgid ""
"**输出数量爆炸。** 三通道联扫 = Na * Nb * Ng。默认 `[-2, 2, 1]` 三通道 = 5^3 "
"= 125 个结构。步长减半会 8 倍增长。建议从单通道开始逐次加。"
msgstr ""
"**Output explodes.** Three channels form a Cartesian product. Start with one "
"channel and estimate the product before adding others."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:127
#: ac092ea4049c4eb299c328377cacaac4
msgid ""
"**角度变化后体积也变了。** 晶格长度保持不变但角度变化会改变笛卡尔空间的矢量投"
"影，体积会轻微变化。这是正常的几何效应，不是 bug。如果体积变化超过预期，可能"
"是角度步长太大——减小 step。"
msgstr ""
"**Volume changes with angle.** This follows from changed vector projections "
"at fixed lengths. If the change exceeds the intended range, reduce angular "
"offsets."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:129
#: bcfec113fcdf4980a77c313b33de5033
msgid ""
"**输出晶格接近奇异。** 如果角度偏离过大导致 cellpar_to_cell 产生的晶格矩阵接"
"近退化，结构会不可用。典型症状是晶格行列式接近 0。把角度 range 回调到更保守的"
"范围。"
msgstr ""
"**The lattice approaches singularity.** Excessive angles can make the cell "
"matrix degenerate. Check its determinant and narrow the range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:131
#: 5e2d17cd09c7421d8f7feeea08bc9587
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

