#: d73d5741ce41438c92b08f6f4afae12a
msgid "`Ang(a={da}°,b={db}°,g={dg}°)` —— 只显示有非零变化的通道。"
msgstr "`Ang(a={da}°,b={db}°,g={dg}°)`; only nonzero channels are included."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:135
